---
import CaseStudy from '../../layouts/CaseStudy.astro';
---

<CaseStudy
  caseTitle="Estampas MobiStudio"
  caseDesc="70+ artes SVG para o catálogo de estampas do MobiStudio — produção gráfica unida ao personalizador interativo proprietário."
  casePath="/projetos/mobi_estampas.html"
  ogImage="/projetos/mobi_estampas/Banner_mobiestampas_21_9.webp"
  heroImageHref="/projetos/mobi_estampas/Banner_mobiestampas_21_9.webp"
>

  <!-- BREADCRUMB -->
  <div class="case-breadcrumb">
    <div class="container case-breadcrumb__inner">
      <a class="case-breadcrumb__link" href="../projetos.html" data-en="← Projects">← Projetos</a>
      <span class="case-breadcrumb__sep">·</span>
      <span class="case-breadcrumb__current" data-en="Case">Case</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CASE HEADER -->
  <section class="case-header" aria-labelledby="case-title">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="case-header__eyebrow" data-en="Case · Graphic Design · Client">
        Case · Design Gráfico · Mobifans
      </p>
      <h1 class="case-header__title" id="case-title">
        Estampas<br />MobiStudio.
      </h1>
      <div class="case-header__meta">
        <span class="case-header__date" data-en="2026">2026</span>
        <div class="case-header__tags">
          <span class="tech-tag">Illustrator</span>
          <span class="tech-tag">SVG</span>
          <span class="tech-tag" data-en="Graphic Design">Design Gráfico</span>
          <span class="tech-tag" data-en="Visual Identity">Identidade Visual</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HERO DO CASE -->
  <div class="case-hero">
    <img class="case-hero__img" src="/projetos/mobi_estampas/Banner_mobiestampas_21_9.webp"
         alt="Estampas MobiStudio — catálogo de artes para o personalizador de capinhas" width="2100" height="900" loading="eager" />
  </div>

  <!-- 01 — CONTEXTO / PROBLEMA -->
  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="ctx-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-section__header">
        <p class="section-label" id="ctx-title" data-en="01 — Context / Problem">01 — Contexto / Problema</p>
        <span class="case-section__note" data-en="tool · catalog · diversity">ferramenta · catálogo · variedade</span>
      </div>
      <div class="case-grid-2" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);" data-en="MobiStudio — Mobifans' phone case customizer — needed a catalog of ready-made artworks to complement the tool. The prints had to be vector-based (SVG) to support dynamic colorization via code, work at any scale, and maintain quality in physical printing.">
            O <strong style="color: var(--color-ink);">MobiStudio</strong> — personalizador de capinhas da Mobifans — precisava de um catálogo de artes prontas para complementar a ferramenta. As estampas precisavam ser vetoriais (SVG) para suportar colorização dinâmica via código, funcionar em qualquer escala e manter qualidade na impressão física.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-muted);" data-en="The challenge was creating 10+ unique artworks that were visually diverse from one another — without repeating concepts — while sharing enough technical consistency to work correctly with the tool's SVG colorization engine.">
            O desafio era criar +10 artes únicas que fossem visualmente diversas entre si — sem repetir conceitos — mas que compartilhassem consistência técnica suficiente para funcionar corretamente com o motor de colorização SVG da ferramenta.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-5);">
          <div style="border: var(--border-thick); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); padding: var(--space-5);">
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);" data-en="Context">Contexto</p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-muted);" data-en="Print catalog for MobiStudio — an internal Mobifans tool for phone case customization. The artworks had to be vector-based and compatible with dynamic CSS/JS colorization.">
              Catálogo de estampas para o MobiStudio — ferramenta interna da Mobifans para personalização de capinhas. As artes precisavam ser vetoriais e compatíveis com colorização dinâmica por CSS/JS.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div style="border: var(--border-thick); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); padding: var(--space-5);">
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);" data-en="Core challenge">Problema central</p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-muted);" data-en="Creating unique artworks with their own personality that still followed a strict technical standard (SVG with colorable paths and a separate background).">
              Criar artes únicas com personalidade própria que ainda seguissem um padrão técnico rígido (SVG com paths coloríveis e fundo separado).
            </p>
          </div>
          <div style="border: var(--border-thick); background: var(--color-yellow); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); padding: var(--space-5);">
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2); color: var(--color-ink);" data-en="Opportunity">Oportunidade</p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-ink);" data-en="Expand the tool's perceived value with a rich catalog — 11 colors × 10+ artworks = over 110 combinations available to the customer.">
              Ampliar o valor percebido da ferramenta com um catálogo rico — 11 cores × +10 artes = mais de 110 combinações disponíveis ao cliente.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 02 — MEU PAPEL -->
  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="papel-title" style="background: var(--color-surface);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-section__header">
        <p class="section-label" id="papel-title" data-en="02 — My Role">02 — Meu Papel</p>
        <span class="case-section__note" data-en="illustration · technical spec · testing">ilustração · spec técnica · teste</span>
      </div>
      <div class="case-grid-3" data-reveal>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="role-card__label" data-en="Responsibility">Responsabilidade</span>
          <h3 class="role-card__title" data-en="Artwork Creation">Criação de Arte</h3>
          <p class="role-card__desc" style="text-align: justify;" data-en="Reference research, hand sketching and digitizing 10+ unique artworks in Illustrator — each with its own concept and style.">
            Pesquisa de referências, rascunho à mão e digitalização de +10 artes únicas no Illustrator — cada uma com conceito e estilo próprios.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="role-card__label" data-en="Responsibility">Responsabilidade</span>
          <h3 class="role-card__title" data-en="Visual Direction">Direção Visual</h3>
          <p class="role-card__desc" style="text-align: justify;" data-en="Defining the 11-color palette and curating which artwork + color combinations worked best visually and technically for the tool.">
            Definição da paleta de 11 cores e curadoria de quais combinações de arte + cor funcionavam melhor visual e tecnicamente para a ferramenta.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="role-card__label" data-en="Responsibility">Responsabilidade</span>
          <h3 class="role-card__title" data-en="SVG Spec">Spec SVG</h3>
          <p class="role-card__desc" style="text-align: justify;" data-en="Exporting and structuring the SVGs according to MobiStudio's technical spec — paths with correct fill, separate background — and testing application on the cases.">
            Exportação e estruturação dos SVGs conforme a spec técnica do MobiStudio — paths com fill correto, fundo separado — e teste de aplicação nas capas.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 03 — PROCESSO & SOLUÇÃO -->
  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="processo-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-section__header">
        <p class="section-label" id="processo-title" data-en="03 — Process & Solution">03 — Processo & Solução</p>
        <span class="case-section__note" data-en="research · drawing · SVG export">pesquisa · desenho · exportação SVG</span>
      </div>

      <div class="case-img-pair" data-reveal>
        <div class="case-img-pair__item">
          <img class="case-img-pair__img" src="/projetos/mobi_estampas/Processo_01.webp" alt="Escolha das estampas e seleção inicial" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="case-img-pair__caption" data-en="step 01 · selection">Passo 01 · Seleção</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-img-pair__item">
          <img class="case-img-pair__img" src="/projetos/mobi_estampas/Processo_02.webp" alt="Pesquisa de referências e moodboard" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="case-img-pair__caption" data-en="step 02 · research & references">Passo 02 · Pesquisa e Referências</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="case-narrative" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" data-en="The process started with broad reference curation — streetwear, graphic art, pop culture — to make sure the catalog had real variety. Every artwork went through a sketch phase before moving to Illustrator, keeping the organic feel of the line even in the final vector.">
        O processo começou com uma curadoria ampla de referências — streetwear, grafismo, cultura pop — para garantir que o catálogo tivesse variedade real. Cada arte passou por rascunho antes de ir para o Illustrator, mantendo a linha orgânica do traço mesmo no vetor final.
      </p>
      <p class="case-narrative" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" data-en="The most important technical constraint: each SVG needed exactly <strong>two separate color elements</strong> (background and artwork), so MobiStudio's colorization engine could paint both independently. That required a specific structure in Illustrator during export.">
        A restrição técnica mais importante: cada SVG precisava ter exatamente <strong>dois elementos de cor separados</strong> (fundo e arte), para que o motor de colorização do MobiStudio pudesse pintar ambos independentemente. Isso exigiu uma estrutura específica no Illustrator durante a exportação.
      </p>

      <div class="case-code" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2" role="region" aria-label="Especificação técnica de exportação SVG das estampas" data-en="&lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;// SVG Spec — required structure for compatibility with buildColoredEstampa()&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class=&quot;tok-keyword&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;svg&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;!-- layer 1: background — a single rect or closed path --&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class=&quot;tok-fn&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;rect&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;id=&quot;bg&quot;&lt;/span&gt; fill=&lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;&quot;#FFFFFF&quot;&lt;/span&gt; width=&lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;&quot;100%&quot;&lt;/span&gt; height=&lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;&quot;100%&quot;&lt;/span&gt; /&amp;gt;

  &lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;!-- layer 2: artwork — all paths with fill=&quot;#000000&quot; --&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class=&quot;tok-fn&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;path&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;id=&quot;art&quot;&lt;/span&gt; fill=&lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;&quot;#000000&quot;&lt;/span&gt; d=&lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;&quot;M...&quot;&lt;/span&gt; /&amp;gt;
  &lt;span class=&quot;tok-fn&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;path&lt;/span&gt; fill=&lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;&quot;#000000&quot;&lt;/span&gt; d=&lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;&quot;M...&quot;&lt;/span&gt; /&amp;gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;tok-keyword&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/svg&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;// Palette: 11 colors — independent bg and fg&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;tok-keyword&quot;&gt;colors&lt;/span&gt; = [&lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;'#1A1A1A'&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;'#FFFFFF'&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;'#E63946'&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;'#F4D35E'&lt;/span&gt;,
          &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;'#06B6D4'&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;'#10B981'&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;'#8B5CF6'&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;'#F97316'&lt;/span&gt;,
          &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;'#EC4899'&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;'#64748B'&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;'#78350F'&lt;/span&gt;]"><span class="tok-comment">// Spec SVG — estrutura obrigatória para compatibilidade com buildColoredEstampa()</span>

<span class="tok-keyword">&lt;svg&gt;</span>
  <span class="tok-comment">&lt;!-- camada 1: fundo — um único rect ou path fechado --&gt;</span>
  <span class="tok-fn">&lt;rect</span> <span class="tok-string">id="bg"</span> fill=<span class="tok-string">"#FFFFFF"</span> width=<span class="tok-string">"100%"</span> height=<span class="tok-string">"100%"</span> /&gt;

  <span class="tok-comment">&lt;!-- camada 2: arte — todos os paths com fill="#000000" --&gt;</span>
  <span class="tok-fn">&lt;path</span> <span class="tok-string">id="art"</span> fill=<span class="tok-string">"#000000"</span> d=<span class="tok-string">"M..."</span> /&gt;
  <span class="tok-fn">&lt;path</span> fill=<span class="tok-string">"#000000"</span> d=<span class="tok-string">"M..."</span> /&gt;
<span class="tok-keyword">&lt;/svg&gt;</span>

<span class="tok-comment">// Paleta: 11 cores — bg e fg independentes</span>
<span class="tok-keyword">cores</span> = [<span class="tok-string">'#1A1A1A'</span>, <span class="tok-string">'#FFFFFF'</span>, <span class="tok-string">'#E63946'</span>, <span class="tok-string">'#F4D35E'</span>,
          <span class="tok-string">'#06B6D4'</span>, <span class="tok-string">'#10B981'</span>, <span class="tok-string">'#8B5CF6'</span>, <span class="tok-string">'#F97316'</span>,
          <span class="tok-string">'#EC4899'</span>, <span class="tok-string">'#64748B'</span>, <span class="tok-string">'#78350F'</span>]</div>

      <div class="case-img-trio" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <img class="case-img-trio__img" src="/projetos/mobi_estampas/Processo_04.webp" alt="Desenhos feitos e artes digitalizadas" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="case-img-pair__caption" data-en="DRAWINGS · DIGITIZED">DESENHOS · DIGITALIZADOS</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img class="case-img-trio__img" src="/projetos/mobi_estampas/Processo_03.webp" alt="Seletor de cores com 11 opções" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="case-img-pair__caption" data-en="COLOR PALETTE · 11 COLORS">PALETA · 11 CORES</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img class="case-img-trio__img" src="/projetos/mobi_estampas/Processo_05.webp" alt="Teste e aplicação das estampas na capa" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="case-img-pair__caption" data-en="APPLICATION TEST · PHONE CASE">TESTE · CAPA APLICADA</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 04 — RESULTADO -->
  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="resultado-title" style="background: var(--color-surface);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-section__header">
        <p class="section-label" id="resultado-title" data-en="04 — Result">04 — Resultado</p>
        <span class="case-section__note" data-en="catalog · live · combinations">catálogo · ao vivo · combinações</span>
      </div>
      <div class="case-resultado" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <div class="metric-cards">
            <div class="metric-card metric-card--accent">
              <p class="metric-card__number">+10</p>
              <p class="metric-card__label" data-en="Unique artworks">Artes únicas</p>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-card metric-card--plain">
              <p class="metric-card__number">11</p>
              <p class="metric-card__label" data-en="Colors per artwork">Cores por arte</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="case-resultado__impact" data-en="<strong>Over 110 combinations available in the catalog.</strong> The prints were integrated into MobiStudio and are live in production in the customizer, expanding the range of personalized cases for Mobifans customers. The SVG technical standard established during this project became the reference for future catalog additions.">
            <strong>Mais de 110 combinações disponíveis no catálogo.</strong> As estampas foram integradas ao MobiStudio e estão em produção no personalizador, ampliando a oferta de capas personalizadas para os clientes da Mobifans. O padrão técnico SVG estabelecido durante este projeto tornou-se a referência para futuras adições ao catálogo.
          </p>
          <div class="projeto__actions">
            <a href="mobi_studio.html" class="btn btn--primary" data-en="See the tool ↗">Ver a ferramenta ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <video muted loop autoplay playsinline class="case-resultado__screenshot" src="/projetos/mobi_estampas/Processo_06.webm"
               alt="Catálogo de estampas no MobiStudio" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy">
            Seu navegador não suporta o elemento de vídeo.
          </video>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRÓXIMO CASE -->
  <section class="case-next" aria-label="Próximo case">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="mobi_alcas.html" class="case-next__card" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <p class="case-next__label" data-en="Next case →">Próximo case →</p>
          <p class="case-next__title" data-en="Straps<br />MobiStudio.">Alças<br />MobiStudio.</p>
        </div>
        <img class="case-next__thumb" src="/projetos/mobi_alcas/Banner_Alças_21_9.webp" alt="Thumbnail Alças MobiStudio" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="case-next__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</CaseStudy>
